{# Delivery rubric — the program-manager closure ledger.
   Phase 4 renders this with the session's findings inventory. The output
   is the closure table every report must carry: each finding, its closure
   state, and its evidence. The lisp_eval convergence check then scores it
   (zero reported-abandoned, zero unowned) before the report is delivered.
   Variables:
     findings — array of objects: { id, title, evidence, state, owner }
       state ∈ { fixed-verified, delegated-tracked, operator-decision,
                  reported-abandoned }
       owner — who holds the next action ("self", "sub-agent:<label>",
               "operator", or "" for unowned) #}
