## Rubric score

- reported-abandoned: {{ findings | selectattr("state", "equalto", "reported-abandoned") | list | length }}
- unowned: {{ findings | rejectattr("owner") | list | length }}

A rubric is green only when both counts are zero. Any reported-abandoned
finding is a role failure — return to Phase 1 and give it a closure path.
Any unowned finding is an open defect in the delivery process itself.

